            <ArticleTitle>The clinical care of adult patients with sickle cell disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>616-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sickle cell disease is the most common inherited disease in the U.K. and is associated with significant morbidity and mortality. All health professionals should be aware of the common acute and chronic complications of sickle cell disease and the basic principles of their management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
